@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantB = demo-merchant-b

### 准备：应用启动建表后执行 scripts/merchant-demo.sql；版本按 GET 结果填写。
### 商家 A 只读自己的两条商品
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### 商家 B 只读自己的商品 201
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}

### 整批成功；两条商品版本各加一，data 返回 [101,102]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"id":101,"price":11.50,"version":0},{"id":102,"price":22.00,"version":0}]}

### 第二项跨商家；409，商品 101 的价格和版本也回滚
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"id":101,"price":99,"version":1},{"id":201,"price":99,"version":0}]}

### 第二项使用旧版本；409，整批回滚
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"id":101,"price":99,"version":1},{"id":102,"price":99,"version":0}]}

### 确认两条商品仍为 11.50 / 22.00、版本均为 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}

### 无凭证：403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products

### 无效凭证：403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/products
Authorization: Bearer invalid

### 商家商品实体禁止通用 HTTP 路由：404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/update
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"id":101,"price":1,"version":1,"merchantId":2001}}
